# Testing

Smoke tests live in `test/` and use `node:test`. No Jest, no extra runner.

- `npm test` is what CI runs, after `npm run lint`.
- Don't point a test at the shared `data/bugs.json`. Set `DATA_FILE` to a temp path, or read `data/seed-bugs.json`.
- Coverage is thin on purpose. The HTTP routes are still untested. Add a case next to the behavior you change instead of a new framework.
